      - he feels dizzy
      - ..
      - you feel dizzy
      - you remember somehow that you should get to work
      - you should...
      - get to....
      - work.....
      - why work?-
      - dont know but its necessary
      - u have a gut feeling that not working will have bad consequences
      - might be that...
      - she may get mad
